            %p
              Together with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hadamard%27s+lemma"} Hadamard's lemma
              in the form
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ForVanishingOrderRhoHadamardExpansion"} (5)
              this means that every
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi b
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi 𝒟
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} b \in \mathcal{D}(\mathbb{R}^n)
              is decomposed as
            #eq:ForExtensionOfDistributionsTestFunctionDecomposition.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (8)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
