                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat{ x^\alpha u}
              to the origin. Accordingly the composition
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi u
                    %mo ∘
                    %msub
                      %mi p
                      %mi ρ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} u \circ p_\rho
              has a unique extension, by
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ForExtensionOfDistributionsTestFunctionDecomposition"} (8)
            #eq:ExtensionOfDitstributionsPointFixedAndChoice.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (9)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
