                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} j_1, \cdots, j_k \in \{0,2\}
              contribute to the above sum. Removing the overcounting of those summands where all
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
